{"seq":1,"slug":"seasonal-npi-listing-countdown","title":"季节新品上架倒排与首单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seasonal-holiday-commerce-calendar/seasonal-supply-readiness/seasonal-npi-listing-countdown","wordCount":1846,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"季节新品上架倒排与首单\">季节新品上架倒排与首单</h1><p>节令新品与常年新品最大的区别是<strong>它有一个不可延期的开卖日</strong>。常年新品晚两周上架，损失的只是两周的曝光；节令新品晚两周上架，可能整批货就撞上了需求曲线的下坡段。因此节令新品的计划方式不是「正排」（今天开始做，做完就上），而是<strong>倒排</strong>——先把开卖日钉死在日历上，再向后逐段扣减，直到推出今天必须完成的第一件事。</p>\n<p>本篇处理这条倒排链：里程碑如何定义、每一段的时长如何取值、首单数量如何定量，以及当倒排结果显示「已经来不及」时该怎么决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>倒排的本质是把「开卖日」当作一个已知点，向前扣除一串有先后依赖的工序。每一步的产出是下一步的输入，因此顺序不可交换。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>里程碑</th>\n<th>产出</th>\n<th>典型时长</th>\n<th>依赖它的下一步</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开卖日（list-off date）</td>\n<td>商品可售</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>需求实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入仓可售</td>\n<td>海外仓上架完成</td>\n<td>3–7 天</td>\n<td>开卖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾程入仓</td>\n<td>货到海外仓</td>\n<td>2–5 天</td>\n<td>上架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清关放行</td>\n<td>缴纳关税、放行</td>\n<td>2–7 天（方差大）</td>\n<td>尾程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>头程在途</td>\n<td>集装箱装船起运</td>\n<td>25–45 天（海运）</td>\n<td>清关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>港口交接</td>\n<td>集港、报关</td>\n<td>3–7 天</td>\n<td>头程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工厂出厂</td>\n<td>完成生产、验货</td>\n<td>15–45 天</td>\n<td>集港</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首单下单</td>\n<td>下达采购单</td>\n<td>1 天</td>\n<td>生产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>打样确认</td>\n<td>样品通过封样</td>\n<td>7–21 天</td>\n<td>下单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>立项</td>\n<td>选品通过、预算批准</td>\n<td>3–14 天</td>\n<td>打样</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把这张表的时长加起来，节令新品从立项到开卖通常需要 <strong>60 到 150 天</strong>——这正是「节日货要提前几个月备」这句话的来源。表中最容易被低估的是清关（方差大）与头程（旺季会显著拉长），这两段在倒排中必须用<strong>悲观值</strong>而不是均值，因为它们决定了整条链最迟能接受的时间点。</p>\n<p>「工厂出厂」这一段同样不是稳定量。春节前后中国工厂的产能会阶段性坍塌，<a href=\"https://www.flexport.com/glossary/chinese-new-year/\">Flexport 的春节术语条目</a>指出工厂在春节期间「停工或减产至少 4 周」（&quot;Factories are closed and/or operating at diminished capacity for at least 4 weeks&quot;）。因此凡是生产窗口跨越春节的节令新品，出厂时长必须按停工周数整体后推，而不是按工作日折算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph RL&#10;  A[立项] --&gt; B[打样确认]&#10;  B --&gt; C[首单下单]&#10;  C --&gt; D[工厂出厂]&#10;  D --&gt; E[集港报关]&#10;  E --&gt; F[头程在途]&#10;  F --&gt; G[清关放行]&#10;  G --&gt; H[尾程入仓]&#10;  H --&gt; I[海外仓上架]&#10;  I --&gt; J[开卖日&lt;br/&gt;固定不动]&#10;  J -.倒排方向.-&gt; A\">graph RL\n  A[立项] --&gt; B[打样确认]\n  B --&gt; C[首单下单]\n  C --&gt; D[工厂出厂]\n  D --&gt; E[集港报关]\n  E --&gt; F[头程在途]\n  F --&gt; G[清关放行]\n  G --&gt; H[尾程入仓]\n  H --&gt; I[海外仓上架]\n  I --&gt; J[开卖日&lt;br/&gt;固定不动]\n  J -.倒排方向.-&gt; A</pre><h3 id=\"用悲观提前期而不是均值\">用悲观提前期而不是均值</h3><p>倒排里每一步应当取该步的<strong>高分位值</strong>（如 P85）而非均值，原因是倒排链的延迟是可累积的：只要有一环超时，后续所有环节的时间点都被推后，而开卖日不能推。最后一步的准时率近似等于各环节准时率的乘积——五环各 95% 准时，整体就只有约 77%。这就是为什么倒排需要对每一环留出缓冲，而缓冲应该加在<strong>方差最大</strong>的环节（清关、头程），而不是平均分摊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"首单数量的定量\">首单数量的定量</h2><p>首单是节令新品唯一一次「一次性决策」：订少了无法在窗口内补货（补货周期比窗口还长），订多了节后砸手里。这与第 1 章选品篇讨论的报童结构完全一致，但首单还多了一层约束——它受<strong>最小起订量</strong>与<strong>产能锁定</strong>的约束，通常不能自由取任意数量。</p>\n<p>首单量的决策顺序应该是：先用服务水平目标算出理论上限，再向下调整到供应商的起订量档位，最后用现金占用约束校验。理论上限用单期报童解给出：目标不缺货概率由毛利与残余价值之比决定（详细推导见 <a href=\"../holiday-calendar-culture/festival-category-culture-fit\">节日品类与消费文化差异选品</a>），据此换算成数量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;sku_id&quot;: &quot;SKU-LED-TREE-180&quot;,&#10;  &quot;festival&quot;: &quot;christmas&quot;,&#10;  &quot;market&quot;: &quot;US&quot;,&#10;  &quot;time_fence&quot;: { &quot;list_off_date&quot;: &quot;2026-11-05&quot;, &quot;order_by_date&quot;: &quot;2026-08-12&quot; },&#10;  &quot;first_order&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;demand_mean&quot;: 4200,&#10;    &quot;demand_std&quot;: 1100,&#10;    &quot;csl_target&quot;: 0.78,&#10;    &quot;theoretical_qty&quot;: 5060,&#10;    &quot;moq&quot;: 5000,&#10;    &quot;supplier_tier_qty&quot;: 5000,&#10;    &quot;cash_cap_qty&quot;: 5400,&#10;    &quot;final_qty&quot;: 5000,&#10;    &quot;binding_constraint&quot;: &quot;moq&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;milestones_frozen_at&quot;: &quot;2026-08-01T00:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sku_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-LED-TREE-180\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"festival\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"christmas\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"time_fence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"list_off_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-11-05\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"order_by_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-08-12\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"first_order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"demand_mean\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"demand_std\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"csl_target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.78</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"theoretical_qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5060</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"moq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"supplier_tier_qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"cash_cap_qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"final_qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"binding_constraint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"moq\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"milestones_frozen_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>binding_constraint</code> 字段是刻意保留的：它记录这个首单量最终是被什么约束定下来的。如果连续两年都是 <code>cash_cap_qty</code> 起作用，说明资金是真正的瓶颈，营运该去谈账期；如果是 <code>moq</code> 起作用，说明采购批量与市场需求不匹配，该去谈更小的起订量或找拼单。</p>\n<h3 id=\"首单定量的工程实现\">首单定量的工程实现</h3><p>把上面这套逻辑落成表结构，关键是让「倒排结果的日期」与「定量结果」都带冻结时间戳，从而与日历主数据形成一致的版本化纪律（见 <a href=\"../holiday-calendar-culture/holiday-calendar-masterdata\">多市场节日历主数据与年度版本</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE seasonal_npi_plan (&#10;  plan_id           BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  sku_id            TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  festival_code     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  market            TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  list_off_date     DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  order_by_date     DATE NOT NULL,       -- 倒排得出的下单截止日&#10;  lead_time_p85     SMALLINT NOT NULL,   -- 总提前期的 P85 值（天）&#10;  first_order_qty   INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;  binding_constraint TEXT NOT NULL&#10;    CHECK (binding_constraint IN (&#39;csl&#39;,&#39;moq&#39;,&#39;cash_cap&#39;,&#39;capacity_lock&#39;)),&#10;  calendar_version  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  frozen_at         TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 每日扫描：距离下单截止日不足 N 天且尚未下单的节令新品&#10;SELECT sku_id, festival_code, order_by_date,&#10;       (order_by_date - CURRENT_DATE) AS days_left&#10;FROM seasonal_npi_plan&#10;WHERE order_by_date &gt;= CURRENT_DATE&#10;  AND NOT EXISTS (&#10;    SELECT 1 FROM purchase_order po&#10;    WHERE po.sku_id = seasonal_npi_plan.sku_id&#10;      AND po.created_at &gt;= seasonal_npi_plan.frozen_at&#10;  )&#10;ORDER BY days_left ASC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> seasonal_npi_plan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plan_id           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  festival_code     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  list_off_date     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_by_date     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 倒排得出的下单截止日</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lead_time_p85     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 总提前期的 P85 值（天）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  first_order_qty   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  binding_constraint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (binding_constraint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'csl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'moq'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cash_cap'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'capacity_lock'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  calendar_version  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  frozen_at         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每日扫描：距离下单截止日不足 N 天且尚未下单的节令新品</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id, festival_code, order_by_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (order_by_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> days_left</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seasonal_npi_plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_by_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> purchase_order po</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> po</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> seasonal_npi_plan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> po</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> seasonal_npi_plan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> days_left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个查询是倒排体系真正的价值落点：它把「计划」变成了「每日可执行的告警」。倒排表如果只是躺在文档里，它就只是一份说明；只有当成表被每日扫描并驱动告警时，它才真正约束住行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"来不及了怎么办\">来不及了怎么办</h2><p>倒排跑出来最常见的结果是「来不及」——距离下单截止日只剩几天，样品还没确认。此时有几条降级路径，它们的代价依次递增，应当按顺序尝试：</p>\n<p><strong>改走空运或快船</strong>。把 25–45 天的海运压到 7–12 天的空运，能追回两三周，代价是单位运费成倍上升。这条路只对高单价、小体积、高毛利的 SKU 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>改用现货或改款</strong>。放弃定制打样，直接采购有现货的相近款式，牺牲差异化换取时间。代价是可能撞款、竞争力下降，但保住了窗口。</p>\n<p><strong>缩小首单、分批到货</strong>。先发一小批用空运抢窗口，大批量仍走海运补货。这是最常用的折中：它承认无法一次性备足，但保住了开卖日的「有货」状态与 listing 的权重积累。</p>\n<p><strong>放弃该节日，转向下一个节日</strong>。如果以上都不可行，正确的做法是把这批货重新定位到下一个节令窗口，而不是硬上。硬上的结果通常是开卖即缺货，把流量与评价权重浪费掉，反而比晚一个节令更亏。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>降级路径</th>\n<th>追回时间</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空运/快船</td>\n<td>2–4 周</td>\n<td>运费成倍上升</td>\n<td>高单价、小体积、高毛利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现货/改款</td>\n<td>3–6 周</td>\n<td>丧失差异化</td>\n<td>品类同质化程度高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缩小首单分批</td>\n<td>1–3 周</td>\n<td>期间可能缺货</td>\n<td>需求可预测、补货可靠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转向下一节令</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>错过本季需求</td>\n<td>上一节令与下一节令品类重叠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>节令新品用倒排而非正排：以开卖日为固定锚点，向前逐段扣减里程碑，总链路通常需 60 至 150 天。</li>\n<li>倒排每一步取悲观分位值（如 P85）而非均值，因为延迟可累积；缓冲应加在方差最大的环节（清关、头程）。</li>\n<li>首单量用报童结构定量，但受最小起订量、产能锁定与现金占用三重约束，记录 <code>binding_constraint</code> 使瓶颈可诊断。</li>\n<li>倒排必须落成可每日扫描的表并驱动告警，否则只是说明文档而非约束。</li>\n<li>来不及时的降级存在优先级：空运/快船 → 现货改款 → 缩小首单分批 → 转向下一节令。</li>\n<li>整条链的日期与定量都应带 <code>frozen_at</code>，与日历主数据的版本化纪律一致。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"季节新品上架倒排与首单","id":"季节新品上架倒排与首单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"用悲观提前期而不是均值","id":"用悲观提前期而不是均值"},{"level":2,"text":"首单数量的定量","id":"首单数量的定量"},{"level":3,"text":"首单定量的工程实现","id":"首单定量的工程实现"},{"level":2,"text":"来不及了怎么办","id":"来不及了怎么办"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多市场节日历主数据与年度版本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seasonal-holiday-commerce-calendar/holiday-calendar-culture/holiday-calendar-masterdata"},"next":{"title":"节日备货提前期与舱位/产能预订","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seasonal-holiday-commerce-calendar/seasonal-supply-readiness/holiday-stockup-capacity-booking"}}